{"availability":"available","full":"bunlongheng/forensic","name":"forensic","description":"Infinite, Figma-fast detective evidence board: pin images and objects, wire connections with red thread, and pull a no-token in-browser OCR case report.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-24T17:16:06Z","updated":"2026-10-06T20:15:38Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://forensic-bheng.vercel.app","topics":["corkboard","evidence-board","figma-like","infinite-canvas","ocr","postgresql","react","react-flow","tesseract","vercel","vite","whiteboard","xyflow"],"demo":"https://forensic-bheng.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:19:57.567Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:19:57.567Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:19:57.567Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:53.432Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:19:57.567Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An infinite, Figma-fast evidence board that lives in the browser.","Pin unlimited images, links, PDFs and notes, zoom without limits, and wire the connections with red threads - like a detective's evidence board, autosaved to Postgres with a local draft for crash safety. 15 evidence types, in-browser OCR, undo history, and a 1-click case report."],"features":["Infinite canvas - pan and zoom without limits (0.02x to 40x), powered by React Flow.","Drop / paste / upload images - drag image files onto the board, paste from the clipboard, or pick from disk. Large images are downscaled and re-encoded (WebP) so a board packed with photos stays fast.","Paste links, PDFs, audio and documents - paste or drag in a URL, a PDF, an audio or video file or a document and it pins as an exhibit card; click its icon to open the real thing in a new tab. Files ride inside the…","Red threads - drag from any node edge to wire it to as many others as you like. Threads attach to the nearest point on each card's boundary and light up when either end is selected.","Auto-thread - multi-select assets and hit Chain (nearest-neighbour path) or Fan (biggest asset out to the rest)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/forensic/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c0e081c265cf6c0784453f7a073747e6fc7b5f078904f647bf74328021b4e221","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:53.562Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:57.829Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An infinite, Figma-fast evidence board that lives in the browser.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/forensic/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The Board chunk is lazy-loaded: sign-in and the gallery never download React Flow or the node types.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/forensic/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Google OAuth owner sign-in (stateless HMAC session cookie); shared boards stay public to view","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/forensic/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"c0e081c265cf6c0784453f7a073747e6fc7b5f078904f647bf74328021b4e221","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/forensic/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:57.830Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T20:15:38Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bunlongheng/forensic/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:57.831Z","hash":"c0e081c265cf6c0784453f7a073747e6fc7b5f078904f647bf74328021b4e221","originalBytes":15884,"storedBytes":15884,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["board","node","cmd","api","server","images","react","run","boards","local","postgres","every","npm","paste","build","dev","drag","selection","set","url","yes","any","env","forensic","group","lib","live","open","production","secret","vercel","canvas","docs","draft","evidence","flow","google","link","note","photo","report","snapshot","src","thread